# Analyzer Schedule Generator — source of truth

This repository (`Analyzer-Schedule-Generator`) is the **only** place to change the public FEL-3 schedule builder app.

## Do

- Edit `index.html`, `css/styles.css`, `js/app.js`, `data/activities.csv`, and `README.md` here.
- Deploy via GitHub Pages (`.github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml`).
- Test locally: `python3 -m http.server 8080` from this repo root.

## Do not

- Edit copies under other workspaces (e.g. `acce_sqlite_cursor_project/Analyzer-Schedule-Generator/`). That nested copy is **deprecated** and not deployed.

## Related repo

The Streamlit piping MTO tool lives in `Template_sqlite_cursor_project` (separate product). Schedule Generator changes stay in **this** repo only.
